//////////////////
////////////////// Controller parameters
//////////////////
2 // Controller type [1: Constant tension, 2: Horizontal control]
1 // Index of the body that is controlled with the winches
0.3679 1 -0.6315 1 // Controller state-space model parameters [A B C D]
1000 1000 30000 // Lead controller gains (Kc)
0.001 0.001 0.0005 // Integral time gains (Ki)
0.9842 0.125 0.1263 0.0 // Filter state-space model parameters [A B C D]
2000.0 // Winches gain (Kw)
5.0 // Time to start controlling the body
0 // Reference flag [0: state-space reference, N>0: N discrete time points]
////////////////// State space reference position
0.9950 0.0625 0.0798 0.0 // Reference state-space model parameters [A B C D]
0.0 0.0 0.0 // Vector of reference positions x(m), y(m), heading(rad)
////////////////// Discrete points reference position (unused when flag=0)
