1 // Flag for inversor block type [1: Straight lines inversor; 2: Coefficients inversor]
10.0 // Maximum tension allowed (tons)
2.0 // Operational minimum tension (tons)
////////////////// Straight lines inversor inputs
500 // Maximum number of iterations for bounded optimization
1e-6 // Absolute tolerance for tension bounds
////////////////// Coefficients inversor inputs
2 // Number of lines for positive X force
1 3 // Indices of lines for positive X force
1.0 1.0 // Coefficients of lines for positive X force
2 // Number of lines for negative X force
2 4 // Indices of lines for negative X force
1.0 1.0 // Coefficients of lines for negative X force
2 // Number of lines for positive Y force
1 2 // Indices of lines for positive Y force
1.0 1.0 // Coefficients of lines for positive Y force
2 // Number of lines for negative Y force
3 4 // Indices of lines for negative Y force
1.0 1.0 // Coefficients of lines for negative Y force
2 // Number of lines for positive YAW force
2 3 // Indices of lines for positive YAW force
1.0 1.0 // Coefficients of lines for positive YAW force
2 // Number of lines for negative YAW force
1 4 // Indices of lines for negative YAW force
